Read-only probes before the test file:

- adv-probe.mjs. spendGuard at 1.59 gives ok, at 1.60 and 1.61 gives refused. At spend 1.59 a
  color call projects 1.6100 and is refused, one line call projects 1.6000 and is allowed. At
  1.60 and 1.61 both commands are refused by the spend check. Float sums: 158 rows give
  1.5800000000000012, 159 rows give 1.5900000000000012, 160 rows give 1.6000000000000012.
  Cost-row parse: a negative cell is kept, a blank cell reads 0, extra columns do not move the
  cost, a header-only file holds no rows, a row with a blank first cell is dropped. Time
  formats: not-a-time, an empty cell, a lowercase z and a trailing space each give 0 tries; a
  date-only time and a space-separated time count. classifyOutDir: the card folder, a trailing
  slash, a trailing /. , ./, and three .. spellings that resolve to the card folder give card;
  cards, cards/muse/elements, cards/MUSE, an absolute outside path and an empty outDir give
  invalid; Cards/muse and a week folder give restart; no outDir gives restart.
- adv-probe2.mjs, temporary repository with both scripts copied and an empty HOME. A card call
  at spend 1.60 exits 3 with refused: spend 1.6000 USD plus 0.01 over cap 1.6. At spend 1.50 it
  prints card run: cap 1.6 USD and the notice at 0.8, then exits 1 with ENOENT, so no provider
  call can start. A mixed call exits 3 with the mix message. A restart scan over a unit root
  that holds Cards, cards and w01 gives restart spend 1.2, so the Cards folder is counted by the
  restart scan and a Cards spelling is a restart call. A header without a time column parses a
  0.9 cost row yet spendTotal reads 0 and countTries reads 0. runGuards on an empty ctx list
  gives run restart. --tries 2.5, abc and -5 are not refused, and 2.5 is not refused at spend
  1.57.
- adv-probe5.mjs. A folder symlink named cards to an outside folder that holds 0.90 gives card
  spend 0.90, so the card scan follows the link. A file symlink on the real card costs file
  also gives 0.90. A folder symlink named w10 gives restart spend 0, which is RB2-2. A unit root
  that holds w01, Cards, CARDS, cards2, card and cards gives restart children CARDS, Cards,
  card, cards2, w01 and card scan child cards.
- adv-probe4.mjs. With an empty env file present, an over-cap card call exits 3 and prints no
  no-key line, so the no-key assertion of a refusal test can fail.

