Findings, ADV-N1 to ADV-N6, all non-blocking. ADV-N1 is Major: the section 6 allowed set of
test-strategy.md names only the guards, specs and fixtures test files, so commit 6d80fba0 sits
outside the set and the phase-acceptance allowed-set check counts one own file outside it. The
owner is the strategy, not Green. The five Nits are: section 4.3 still claims exact string
equality for the outDir match; the CostRow declaration names three fields the parser does not
fill; --tries is not validated as an integer; the CG3 single-owner scan uses an equals-only
pattern on two files; and a header without a time column fails open, which extends RB-4.

